Lab patch 0001: settings fail closed (agentic/project_settings.py).

Why: upstream load_project_settings() swallows any webapp error and falls back to
DEFAULT_AGENT_SETTINGS, whose model is the hosted claude-opus-4-6 (lines 1043-1060
at 73ca9d3), and a failed provider fetch leaves an empty provider list (lines
797-808). A run must never silently move off the tap's model, so both now raise
SettingsUnavailable. Patch 0002 turns that into a non-recoverable run error.

